  "worked_solution": "The complement of $D,$ denoted $\\overset{\u2015}{D},$ consists of every element in the universal set $U$ that is not in the set $D.$\n\nThe elements of $U$ that are not in $D$ are $b,$ $c,$ $e,$ $f,$ and $h.$\n\nTherefore, the complement of $D$ is\n\n$$\n\\overset{\u2015}{D}={b,c,e,f,h}.\n$$",
